{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgHYikNciGVe4jbrMGH2x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"theme\":{\"background\":\"FFFFFF\",\"ink\":\"000000\",\"accent\":\"808080\",\"font\":\"Arial\"},\"slides\":[{\"background\":\"FFFFFF\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"header\",\"title\":\"Inventory Reorder Protocol: when and how to reorder\",\"subtitle\":\"Learning goal for junior stockroom coordinators  |  All data are synthetic\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":5.6,\"h\":0.4,\"text\":\"LEARNING GOAL\",\"size\":12,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"808080\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":2.15,\"w\":5.6,\"h\":1.6,\"text\":\"Apply one simple reorder-point rule to decide, every day, whether to place a restocking order.\",\"size\":24,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":3.85,\"w\":5.6,\"h\":1.4,\"text\":\"We explain the logic, work through one example, then give a short practice exercise. The answer is revealed on the slide after the exercise.\",\"size\":16,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"rect\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":5.45,\"w\":5.6,\"h\":1.35,\"fill\":\"F2F2F2\"},{\"type\":\"rect\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":5.45,\"w\":0.08,\"h\":1.35,\"fill\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.8,\"y\":5.55,\"w\":5.25,\"h\":1.15,\"text\":\"Outcome: from three counts (on-hand, on-order, committed) and one trigger, you can state ORDER or WAIT and show the arithmetic.\",\"size\":14,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"table\",\"x\":6.75,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":6.03,\"h\":5.05,\"size\":13,\"header_fill\":\"000000\",\"header_color\":\"FFFFFF\",\"fill\":\"FFFFFF\",\"color\":\"000000\",\"rows\":[[\"Slide\",\"Topic\",\"What you will do\"],[\"2\",\"Rule\",\"Learn the two formulas and the trigger\"],[\"3\",\"Worked example\",\"Calculate a reorder point with units\"],[\"4\",\"Inventory\",\"Compute inventory position; decide\"],[\"5\",\"Process\",\"Follow the daily decision loop\"],[\"6\",\"Practice\",\"Decide ORDER or WAIT yourself\"],[\"7\",\"Misconceptions\",\"Check the answer; avoid three errors\"],[\"8\",\"Checklist\",\"Verify before ordering\"]]}]},{\"background\":\"FFFFFF\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"header\",\"title\":\"The rule: compare inventory position with the reorder point\",\"subtitle\":\"Two formulas and one decision, applied at every daily review\"},{\"type\":\"rect\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":7.3,\"h\":1.35,\"fill\":\"F2F2F2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.75,\"y\":1.85,\"w\":6.9,\"h\":0.35,\"text\":\"1   REORDER POINT (the trigger)\",\"size\":12,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"808080\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.75,\"y\":2.2,\"w\":6.9,\"h\":0.8,\"text\":\"Reorder point = daily demand × lead time (days) + safety stock\",\"size\":18,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"rect\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":3.25,\"w\":7.3,\"h\":1.35,\"fill\":\"F2F2F2\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.75,\"y\":3.35,\"w\":6.9,\"h\":0.35,\"text\":\"2   INVENTORY POSITION\",\"size\":12,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"808080\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.75,\"y\":3.7,\"w\":6.9,\"h\":0.8,\"text\":\"Inventory position = on-hand + on-order − committed\",\"size\":18,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"rect\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":4.75,\"w\":7.3,\"h\":1.35,\"fill\":\"D9D9D9\"},{\"type\":\"rect\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":4.75,\"w\":0.08,\"h\":1.35,\"fill\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.75,\"y\":4.85,\"w\":6.9,\"h\":0.35,\"text\":\"3   DECISION\",\"size\":12,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"404040\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.75,\"y\":5.2,\"w\":6.9,\"h\":0.8,\"text\":\"If inventory position ≤ reorder point → ORDER.\\nOtherwise → WAIT.\",\"size\":18,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":6.25,\"w\":7.3,\"h\":0.55,\"text\":\"Units: demand in units/day, lead time in days, all stock in units. Convert everything to units before comparing.\",\"size\":12,\"color\":\"404040\"},{\"type\":\"table\",\"x\":8.15,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":4.63,\"h\":5.05,\"size\":12,\"header_fill\":\"000000\",\"header_color\":\"FFFFFF\",\"fill\":\"FFFFFF\",\"color\":\"000000\",\"rows\":[[\"Term\",\"Meaning (unit)\"],[\"Daily demand\",\"Average units used per day (units/day)\"],[\"Lead time\",\"Days from placing an order to receipt (days)\"],[\"Safety stock\",\"Buffer for demand or delay surprises (units)\"],[\"On-hand\",\"Units physically in the stockroom (units)\"],[\"On-order\",\"Units ordered, not yet received (units)\"],[\"Committed\",\"Units promised to jobs, not yet issued (units)\"]]}]},{\"background\":\"FFFFFF\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"header\",\"title\":\"Worked example: the reorder point is 134 units\",\"subtitle\":\"18 units/day × 6 days = 108 units of lead-time demand; + 26 units safety stock = 134 units\"},{\"type\":\"kpi\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":2.85,\"h\":1.1,\"value\":\"18 units/day\",\"label\":\"Daily demand\",\"color\":\"808080\"},{\"type\":\"kpi\",\"x\":3.676,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":2.85,\"h\":1.1,\"value\":\"6 days\",\"label\":\"Lead time\",\"color\":\"808080\"},{\"type\":\"kpi\",\"x\":6.802,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":2.85,\"h\":1.1,\"value\":\"26 units\",\"label\":\"Safety stock\",\"color\":\"808080\"},{\"type\":\"kpi\",\"x\":9.928,\"y\":1.75,\"w\":2.85,\"h\":1.1,\"value\":\"134 units\",\"label\":\"Reorder point (result)\",\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"table\",\"x\":0.55,\"y\":3.1,\"w\":6.6,\"h\":2.95,\"size\":13,\"header_fill\":\"000000\",\"header_color\":\"FFFFFF\",\"fill\":\"FFFFFF\",\"color\":\"000000\",\"rows\":[[\"Step\",\"Calculation\",\"Result\",\"Unit logic\"],[\"1  Lead-time demand\",\"18 units/day × 6 days\",\"108 units\",\"days cancel, leaving units\"],[\"2  Add safety stock\",\"108 units + 26 units\",\"134 units\",\"units + units = units\"],[\"3  Set the trigger\",\"Reorder point\",\"134 units\",\"compare inventory position with 134\"]]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":7.55,\"y\":3.1,\"w\":5.23,\"h\":0.35,\"text\":\"Cumulative units needed over the 6-day lead time\",\"size\":12,\"bold\":true,\"color\":\"000000\"},{\"type\":\"chart\",\"x\":7.55,\"y\"